# Battle against Ting-Lu (the Ruinous Pokémon of the vessel): the Treasures of Ruin's four-note creep, down and back,
# ground out by tuba and timpani under a heavy horn in C minor, half time. Original composition for this game.
# Arranged again for the modern sound (plan 31 · MU7) on the instruments of Paldea: a string orchestra, a flamenco guitar strumming the choir's chords and castanets clicking on the bass's eighths (MU6's instruments since; a wood block in the red).
